    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/957a1e3f0d4faf535f41122cf8fac165.poster.avif?t=1754850441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/957a1e3f0d4faf535f41122cf8fac165.webm?t=1754850441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/957a1e3f0d4faf535f41122cf8fac165.mp4?t=1754850441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dimhaven</strong> is a remote island in the middle of nowhere, covered with mountains,shrouded in mist and desolation. The once lively tourist paradise is now left almost completely abandoned and isolated by the mysterious events of the last few years.<br><br>A mixture of <strong>adventure, puzzle</strong> solving and <strong>exploration-driven</strong> storytelling like never seen before: Dimhaven is a story we\u2019ve wanted to tell for years. <strong>Pick up your camera</strong> and test your wits in this first-person mystery by the team that brought you Quern!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/b6d80575edbaff2300b6389286a28d25.poster.avif?t=1754850441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/b6d80575edbaff2300b6389286a28d25.webm?t=1754850441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/b6d80575edbaff2300b6389286a28d25.mp4?t=1754850441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dimhaven Enigmas</strong> is the new project from the developers of <strong>Quern</strong>. An immersive, narrative-driven adventure, where you take on the role of Emily Ravenstone on a mission to find your uncle on the strange island.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/957a1e3f0d4faf535f41122cf8fac165.poster.avif?t=1754850441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/957a1e3f0d4faf535f41122cf8fac165.webm?t=1754850441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/957a1e3f0d4faf535f41122cf8fac165.mp4?t=1754850441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dimhaven</strong> is a remote island in the middle of nowhere, covered with mountains,shrouded in mist and desolation. The once lively tourist paradise is now left almost completely abandoned and isolated by the mysterious events of the last few years.<br><br>A mixture of <strong>adventure, puzzle</strong> solving and <strong>exploration-driven</strong> storytelling like never seen before: Dimhaven is a story we\u2019ve wanted to tell for years. <strong>Pick up your camera</strong> and test your wits in this first-person mystery by the team that brought you Quern!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/b6d80575edbaff2300b6389286a28d25.poster.avif?t=1754850441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/b6d80575edbaff2300b6389286a28d25.webm?t=1754850441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458980/extras/b6d80575edbaff2300b6389286a28d25.mp4?t=1754850441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dimhaven Enigmas</strong> is the new project from the developers of <strong>Quern</strong>. An immersive, narrative-driven adventure, where you take on the role of Emily Ravenstone on a mission to find your uncle on the strange island.",
